    "detailed_description": "<strong>THE SOUL OF TOO BIRDS GAME.</strong><br><br>An interactive experience designed to accompany Melbourne experimental hip hop group <i>Too Birds'</i> 2023 album, <strong>The Soul of Too Birds.</strong> This interactive multimedia companion piece mutates <i>Too Birds'</i> chaotic, noisy soundscapes and opaque lyrics into otherworldly labrinyths where you are given but one objective: destroy the paintings and ultimately, free the soul.<br><br>Drawing inspiration from an esoteric mix of influences, <i>Too Birds'</i> brutal and cryptic sound blends elements of harsh noise, hip-hop, and industrial metal to create a relentless auditory deluge. <i>Too Birds</i> personnel <i>Teether, Realname,</i> and <i>Mr. Society</i> concoct a musical experience that pushes the envelope in all directions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572280/extras/fdb7862d607c5006471ee46afad96c40.avif?t=1751015836\" width=480 height=360 /></span><br><br>Now, you might be wondering, &quot;what features and content can I expect from this game?&quot;. Well, there are many features and contents within this game. Here is a list of the game's features and contents:<br>- Exist in a world.<br>- Move around, said world.<br>- Look at things.<br>- Destroy paintings with your powerful hands.<br>- Listen to the album <strong>The Soul of Too Birds</strong>.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>THE SOUL OF TOO BIRDS GAME.</strong><br><br>An interactive experience designed to accompany Melbourne experimental hip hop group <i>Too Birds'</i> 2023 album, <strong>The Soul of Too Birds.</strong> This interactive multimedia companion piece mutates <i>Too Birds'</i> chaotic, noisy soundscapes and opaque lyrics into otherworldly labrinyths where you are given but one objective: destroy the paintings and ultimately, free the soul.<br><br>Drawing inspiration from an esoteric mix of influences, <i>Too Birds'</i> brutal and cryptic sound blends elements of harsh noise, hip-hop, and industrial metal to create a relentless auditory deluge. <i>Too Birds</i> personnel <i>Teether, Realname,</i> and <i>Mr. Society</i> concoct a musical experience that pushes the envelope in all directions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572280/extras/fdb7862d607c5006471ee46afad96c40.avif?t=1751015836\" width=480 height=360 /></span><br><br>Now, you might be wondering, &quot;what features and content can I expect from this game?&quot;. Well, there are many features and contents within this game. Here is a list of the game's features and contents:<br>- Exist in a world.<br>- Move around, said world.<br>- Look at things.<br>- Destroy paintings with your powerful hands.<br>- Listen to the album <strong>The Soul of Too Birds</strong>.",
